Alembic migration environment for Atlas.

  versions/         the revisions themselves, one file each
  env.py            resolves ATLAS_DATABASE_URL and configures the run
  script.py.mako    the template a new revision is generated from

Do not run `alembic` here without a config path — use the Makefile targets
(`make db-upgrade`, `make db-current`, `make db-check`) or
`alembic -c apps/api/alembic.ini <command>`.

The workflow, and why this replaced hand-applied SQL, is in docs/migrations.md.
